:"Sibyl, a jaded psychotherapist, returns to her first passion: writing. But her newest patient Margot, a troubled up-and-coming actress, proves to be a source of inspiration that is far too tempting. Fascinated almost to the point of obsession, Sibyl becomes more and more involved in Margot’s tumultuous life, reviving volatile memories that bring her face to face with her past."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Sibyl est une ancienne romancière reconvertie en psychanalyste depuis dix ans. Poussée par le désir d'écrire à nouveau, elle se résout à quitter la majorité de ses patients. Alors qu'elle manque d'inspiration, une jeune femme la contacte un soir et la supplie de la recevoir. Sibyl finit par accepter. Les révélations de Margot vont peu à peu bouleverser la vie de Sibyl…"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lGRGKDbMh9dzd87MavABJVhdV89.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/po4p0AfL0NrjQ5S219L6XOEUywn.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":559401,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lGRGKDbMh9dzd87MavABJVhdV89.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lGRGKDbMh9dzd87MavABJVhdV89.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lGRGKDbMh9dzd87MavABJVhdV89.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lGRGKDbMh9dzd87MavABJVhdV89.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/34l8mE0A2UJ9F1VpRD9CEWgD1UD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/34l8mE0A2UJ9F1VpRD9CEWgD1UD.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9W4pznUF8Np6qHExgclaRHVHzom.jpg","pr